holders. This license does
not restrict the Licensor's own use or separately authorized deployments.
All rights not expressly granted are reserved, subject to applicable law.
Nothing here limits uses that applicable law permits without a license.

5. Excluded materials

Exam sheets, questions, assessment criteria, attachments, solutions, and
other third-party educational materials are excluded from this license.
This exclusion also covers reproductions, extracts, split PDFs, preview
images, and exam content embedded in catalog data, regardless of file format
or location. In particular, exam materials in public/pdfs/, public/previews/,
and public/data/ are excluded. Original software and original catalog
descriptions remain subject to this license.

Rights to excluded materials remain with their respective rights holders.
This license grants no rights to those materials and imposes no additional
restrictions on their use. Their inclusion does not declare them public
