Third-party software, dependencies, icons, and other assets retain their
own licenses. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for source information.

6. Termination

Your permissions under this license end automatically if you breach its
terms. They are reinstated if you remedy the breach within 30 days after
first learning of it. This automatic reinstatement is available only once;
after a later breach, reinstatement requires the Licensor's written consent.
Termination does not terminate the rights of recipients who comply with
this license.

